# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .gitignore
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Git exclusion rules
# * Function     : Keeps build output, IDE state, local secrets and container
# *                volumes out of version control. No legacy equivalent exists;
# *                per the repository survey no ignore configuration was present
# *                anywhere, so this convention is established rather than
# *                inherited. NOTHING under app/ is ever ignored - the COBOL
# *                corpus is the frozen reference of record.
